Axtik — Local Apex evaluator and test engine

The executable, package and integration namespace is currently APX/apx.

Original engine and integration source is distributed under Apache License 2.0.
Third-party components retain their respective licenses and notices.

The native engine uses tree-sitter and tree-sitter-sfapex, serde, regex,
num-bigint, num-rational and their dependencies. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
and Cargo.lock for exact versions and licenses.

The Salesforce CLI adapter uses Salesforce's public sf-plugins-core and oclif
libraries. Their production dependencies and license files are included in
the packaged plugin. The VS Code adapter uses the public VS Code API.

Salesforce and Visual Studio Code names identify interoperability targets.
This independent project is not an official Salesforce or Microsoft product.
